	fi
fi
text Nevertheless, for some reason later in the year, we played basketball to make that happen.
text Basketball is a game where you shoot a ball through a hoop to try to score the most points.
text We were against these guys who played basketball basically every day.
text But we won.
text And guess what your mommy said.
text She said that in the short time we were together, our bonds became deeper than the ones formed by the guys who practiced basketball every day.
text She was so happy...
text Mommy loved it when we all came together and worked hard toward a common goal.
