text Mommy stood on stage all alone to represent the drama club there.
text She was gonna have to act in front of a ton of people.
text Someone as awkward and afraid of big crowds as her; can you believe it?
text There was an issue that happened before that however, so she ended up crying on stage...
text But she was still able to finish the whole thing.
text She saw it through.
text And at the end... She sang the Big Dango Family song that she loved so much...
text The song goes, "Dango, dango...!"
text It was her favorite song.
text We were all surprised and embarrassed when we heard it, but...
text By doing that, she was able to make my dreams, and the dreams of everyone else, come true.
text It was... a pretty awesome moment for everyone. One that we'll never forget, that's for sure.
