text Eventually, the two of us began to live together...
text She struggled for about a year, and during that whole time, we kept telling each other that we were becoming stronger...
text And while it took a little longer than most people...
text And though it was a harder path for her than for most people...
text She was finally able to graduate too.
text After that, the two of us lived modestly and worked to protect our home...
text And while we did, Mommy got pregnant with you...
text And then...
