text @[Tomoya]
text With the kind of strength that only a mother could have... she gave birth to you.
text @[Tomoya]
text She was so weak when we first met...
text @[Tomoya]
text But she lived with such strength at the end...
text @[Tomoya]
text She really was so strong...
text @[Tomoya]
text Ushio...
text @[Tomoya]
text You're the daughter... of that strong, strong woman: Mommy.
text Ah... The memories are coming back to me so vividly that it hurts.
text I loved her.
text I truly did love her.
text I loved Nagisa like I loved no one else.
text I loved her for how modest she was.
text I loved how she would sometimes refuse to back down.
text I loved how cute her smile was.
text And...
text I loved her for always being by my side, through everything.
