text But then...
text Why...
text Why aren't you by my side right now...?
text Why did you leave me here on my own...?
text I wanted to do everything with you...
text I always wanted to be together with you...
text You said you'd always be with me...
text Why did you have to go first...?
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa...
text @[Tomoya]
text Nagisa...
text Tears begin to drip from my eyes.
text There's nothing I can do to stop them.
text I wipe my eyes again and again, but they continue to pour.
text @[Tomoya]
text Haha... Hahaha...
text I continue to cry through my laughter.
text I hadn't cried for all this time...
text I thought I was able to live without having to face the facts...
