text What is it?
text @[Tomoya]
text Well, if you insist...
text @[Tomoya]
text Until this evening...
text No, I want a little more time.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Would it be okay for Ushio to stay with you until tomorrow morning?
sound P9T.aac
text @[Sanae]
text Of course I don't mind.
